{"4639140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dough it Yourself", "steam_appid": 4639140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own self-sufficient farm and bakery, where everything you create comes from your own hands.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.mp4?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start with a small plot of land and turn it into a thriving homestead. Grow your own crops, take care of animals, and use machines to process raw ingredients into high-quality goods. From freshly harvested wheat to warm bread straight out of the oven, every step of production is yours to master.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad34003b7d6f77046b3.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad34003b7d6f77046b3.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad34003b7d6f77046b3.mp4?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your bakery by crafting and baking a variety of products, serving customers, and expanding your business. Improve your workflow, unlock new recipes, and upgrade your farm to become fully independent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/21bd2bf0ede0cc3b34bbbd40427ac93f.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/21bd2bf0ede0cc3b34bbbd40427ac93f.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/21bd2bf0ede0cc3b34bbbd40427ac93f.mp4?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your land the way you like—decorate your farm, optimize production chains, and create a place that feels truly your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/4fd7f815c58e4c4294f9af9cee849124.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/4fd7f815c58e4c4294f9af9cee849124.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/4fd7f815c58e4c4294f9af9cee849124.mp4?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Grow and harvest your own crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Raise and manage farm animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Process ingredients using machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bake and craft products in your own bakery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Serve customers and grow your business</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize and decorate your farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build a fully self-sufficient production system</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own self-sufficient farm and bakery, where everything you create comes from your own hands.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/49782ef7ba600876687ad63b4216887b.mp4?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start with a small plot of land and turn it into a thriving homestead. Grow your own crops, take care of animals, and use machines to process raw ingredients into high-quality goods. From freshly harvested wheat to warm bread straight out of the oven, every step of production is yours to master.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad34003b7d6f77046b3.poster.avif?t=1788210025\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad34003b7d6f77046b3.webm?t=1788210025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639140/extras/af1b8b25b600dad